tationJuly292026Signed.pdf","page":33.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"Royal Enfield launched the Flying Flea C6 electric motorcycle and opened the brand's first retail store in Bengaluru.","quote":"Royal Enﬁeld launched the Flying Flea C6, the ﬁrst motorcycle under its new City+ electric mobility brand- Flying Flea, along with the brand's ﬁrst store in Bengaluru.","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/EICHERMOT_29072026190931_EMLInvestorPresentationJuly292026Signed.pdf","page":37.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"Royal Enfield introduced the Bullet 650 across India, EMEA, and ANZ to expand its 650cc range.","quote":"Royal Enﬁeld launched the Bullet 650 across India, EMEA and ANZ expanding its 650cc motorcycle portfolio with the iconic Bullet DNA.","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/EICHERMOT_29072026190931_EMLInvestorPresentationJuly292026Signed.pdf","page":38.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"VECV expanded its service network by adding 30 touchpoints during Q1 FY27, including four new SCV locations.","quote":"SERVICE GROWTH - 30 TOUCH POINTS ADDED IN Q1 FY27 SCV : 4 new SCV locations East Focus: 376 locations; covering all 7 NE states","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/EICHERMOT_29072026190931_EMLInvestorPresentationJuly292026Signed.pdf","page":59.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"tone","statement":"neutral","quote":"Although Eicher Motors Limited (EML) believes that the expectations reﬂected in such forward-looking statements are reasonable, there can be no assurance that such expectations will prove to be correct.","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/EICHERMOT_29072026190931_EMLInvestorPresentationJuly292026Signed.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"Eicher Motors achieved record first-quarter consolidated revenue of INR 6,632 crores, representing a 32% increase year-on-year.","quote":"EML clocked its best ever Q1 revenue of INR 6,632 crores, marking a growth of 32% over INR 5,042 crores fiom Q1 of last year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/rahulrathore_royalenfield_com_04082026143907_TranscriptofConferencecalljuly292026.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"VECV experienced a decline in its first-quarter EBITDA margin to 8.4% from 9.2% in the prior year.","quote":"The EBITDA margin for Q1 8.4% against 9.2% of last year. PAT for Q1 INR 300 crores against INR 288 crores of last year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/rahulrathore_royalenfield_com_04082026143907_TranscriptofConferencecalljuly292026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Management expects to maintain growth momentum while building channel inventory for the festive period.","quote":"As we navigate global headwinds, our fundamentals remain very strong, and We are well on track to maintain our growth momentum, especially as we build inventory for the upcoming festive period.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/rahulrathore_royalenfield_com_04082026143907_TranscriptofConferencecalljuly292026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"Leading demand indicators including bookings, walk-ins, and phone inquiries are expanding faster than volume growth.","quote":"Even our other funnel indicators such as overall booking, walk-ins, telephonic inquiry, etcetera, continue to maintain a very strong growth, which is slightly higher than our volume growth.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/rahulrathore_royalenfield_com_04082026143907_TranscriptofConferencecalljuly292026.pdf","page":9.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"Royal Enfield increased prices across most of its 350cc motorcycles by 1.75% in April 2026.","quote":"The thing is we've also to partly mitigate the impact, we've increased the prices of majority of our 350ce motorcycles by 1.75% in April '26.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/rahulrathore_royalenfield_com_04082026143907_TranscriptofConferencecalljuly292026.pdf","page":9.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"The company faced rising prices across commodities including aluminum, crude oil, steel, and copper, alongside supply chain disruptions.","quote":"So key commodities, aluminum, crude oil, steel, copper, precious metals, everything have gone up. In addition, we've also obviously had some disruption in supply chain and logistics.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/rahulrathore_royalenfield_com_04082026143907_TranscriptofConferencecalljuly292026.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"Higher commodity and processing input costs created a negative 4% to 4.5% net margin impact during the quarter.","quote":"In the quarter, we've had a net impact of about 4% to 4.5% on account of increase input cost of commodity as well as some of the processes involved.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/rahulrathore_royalenfield_com_04082026143907_TranscriptofConferencecalljuly292026.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capex","statement":"The Board approved an investment of INR 1,225 crores for Phase 1 of a greenfield manufacturing plant in Tada.","quote":"Today, the Board has approved an investment of INR1,225 crores for the Phase 1 of the greenfield expansion at Tada, which at full utilization can produce an additional 4.5 lakh motoreycles per year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/rahulrathore_royalenfield_com_04082026143907_TranscriptofConferencecalljuly292026.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capacity","statement":"The addition of the first module at Cheyyar brought built annual production capacity to approximately 1.5 million motorcycles.","quote":"And the current capacity, which we are talking about, with the first module, which we have been talking about at Cheyyar, the build capacity has come to almost about 1.5 million motorcycles per year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/rahulrathore_royalenfield_com_04082026143907_TranscriptofConferencecalljuly292026.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"The company launched the Flying Flea C6, entering the electric motorcycle space under its Flying Flea brand.","quote":"On the product front, we kick started the year with the launch of Flying Flea C6, as I mentioned, the first electric motorcycle under our city+ electric mobility brand, Flying Flea.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/rahulrathore_royalenfield_com_04082026143907_TranscriptofConferencecalljuly292026.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"risks","statement":"The company encountered LPG shortages in the first quarter and adapted by switching back to piped natural gas.","quote":"First is in the quarter 1, what else has happened is, we had LPG shortage issues, and we managed it by actually converting back to a PNG.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/rahulrathore_royalenfield_com_04082026143907_TranscriptofConferencecalljuly292026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"tone","statement":"positive","quote":"And in both the businesses, we are very optimistic of the remaining quarters in the growth.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/rahulrathore_royalenfield_com_04082026143907_TranscriptofConferencecalljuly292026.pdf","page":21.0,"kind":"extracted"}],"kpis":[{"kpi":"Sales volume (units)","value":24815.0,"unit":"units","doc_kind":"presentation","